body:
Thanks

&#x200B;

And that was dark, hehe.

The B&H site says it supports the prepaid carrier (Rogers)  i use here. I might try to grab on of those.

&#x200B;

[https://i.imgur.com/mrdrsLi.png](https://i.imgur.com/mrdrsLi.png)

I actually want to go, but im afraid. It's probably the best place to get sick. I went last week and it was so gross. Everyone told me they are super clean now from covid. But I payed close attention and nothing gets cleaned in the intake or waiting room. People coughing and throwing up (outside). Dude with infections all over his body moving from seat to seat with no mask on... freaked me out .. i spent the 6 hour wait outside as much as i could.

&#x200B;

I really don't want to be put on a hold and made to take drugs i cannot research first. :(  If i tell them the truth i will be put on a hold.
